# Source integrals `∫ h₊ S_k` at `L = 11/8`, `71 ≤ k ≤ 250`

Boxes proposed by `tools/gen_tau_r1_118.py` (untrusted) and checked in batches of five by
`CvSTauL118V1.tauCheck` with `decide +kernel`; `CvSTauL118V1.tauCheck_sound` turns them into
enclosures. These are the digamma parts of `τ_k` for the rows `70 < |k| ≤ 250` of the `L = 11/8`
window. Not RH.
-/

